From: Arnaud Pouliquen <arnaud.pouliquen@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Nov 2025 11:47:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 266/913] dts: stm32: align stm33mp235f-DK RIF with
 stm32mp257f-DK RIF settings

- RIF_EXTI1_RESOURCE(59, 73, 77, 78, 79): set to NPRIV
- RIF_EXTI2_RESOURCE(17, 34, 40): set to NPRIV
- RIF_EXTI2_RESOURCE(49, 63): disable RIF
- RIF_EXTI2_RESOURCE(66): set SEC
- RIF_RCC_RESOURCE(104): DDR: disable RIF
- hpdma_lli: set Privilege attribute for Linux kernel usage
- bl31_context align with EV1 board

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git f92f7d8a131b7bd3f86a7d1d35b08e0a35c5665d dts: stm32: align stm33mp235f-DK RIF with stm32mp257f-DK RIF settings]
